    \spii They must be in a subdirectory of fonts/opentype^^J%%
    \spii in your texmf-dist, texmf-local, or texmf home path.^^J%%
    \spii If you are sure that they are there, try these shell commands:^^J%%
    \spiv mktexlsr^^J%%
    \spiv luaotfload-tool --cache=erase^^J%%
    \spiv luaotfload-tool -u^^J%%
    \spii Your last resort is to place the required fonts in the same folder^^J%%
